<td>${latency(percentile(list.filter(r=>r.transport!=='running').map(r=>r.duration)))}</td><td><button data-drill="${E(name)}">查看记录</button></td></tr>`;}).join('')}</tbody></table></div>${rows.length?'':'<div class="blank-state">暂无请求数据。<button data-go="connections">配置接入 →</button></div>'}<p class="subtle">仅统计已保留数据；缓存不重复计入总量。模型完成不等于任务成功，本版不生成质量评分或费用估算。</p></div>`;
